  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve03",
      "hash64": "1B951F30F6EA9DD4",
      "text": "聽說洛托姆進到微波爐去的話，\\n就會變身成加熱洛托姆！\\r\\n而且連屬性都會改變喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve05",
      "hash64": "1B951D30F6EA9A6E",
      "text": "聽說還有會擬態成水果的寶可夢呢～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve06",
      "hash64": "1B951C30F6EA98BB",
      "text": "吃飯來提升食力！\\n不曉得能不能也提升成績呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve07",
      "hash64": "1B951B30F6EA9708",
      "text": "還沒吃之前我就想再來一碗了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve13",
      "hash64": "1B919F30F6E78E7D",
      "text": "兩個人一起做的三明治，\\n一起吃會更好吃呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve14",
      "hash64": "1B919830F6E78298",
      "text": "在三明治裡加水果進去也很好吃呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve18",
      "hash64": "1B919430F6E77BCC",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve19",
      "hash64": "1B919530F6E77D7F",
      "text": "聽說在別的地區正流行\\n一種叫做咖哩飯的食物……\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳有吃過咖哩飯嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve20",
      "hash64": "1B9C0E30F6F09F9F",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en01",
      "hash64": "8777D1A0A0A0094D",
      "text": "冰箱的旁邊意外地很熱～呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en02",
      "hash64": "8777CEA0A0A00434",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en03",
      "hash64": "8777CFA0A0A005E7",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en04",
      "hash64": "8777CCA0A0A000CE",
      "text": "學生食堂總是很熱鬧呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en05",
      "hash64": "8777CDA0A0A00281",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en09",
      "hash64": "8777C9A0A09FFBB5",
      "text": "和寶可夢一起品茶，\\n真是優雅的時光呀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en10",
      "hash64": "877B36A0A0A2EAC3",
      "text": "在晚上品茶\\n也是別有一番情調啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
